{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020490/extras/6157905b0e6e2cd73cb8ea4218d0964a.poster.avif?t=1758840944\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020490/extras/6157905b0e6e2cd73cb8ea4218d0964a.webm?t=1758840944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020490/extras/6157905b0e6e2cd73cb8ea4218d0964a.mp4?t=1758840944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fight <i>1-4 Friends online</i> with words in this fast paced platform fighter.</strong> Use voice recognition to perform various moves or spit out one liners to power up and knockout your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020490/extras/a5a829f8b0653feeda113bc3dac99ac4.poster.avif?t=1758840944\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020490/extras/a5a829f8b0653feeda113bc3dac99ac4.webm?t=1758840944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020490/extras/a5a829f8b0653feeda113bc3dac99ac4.mp4?t=1758840944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from a roster of distinct characters, each with their own signature moves and mechanics.</strong> Master your fighter\u2019s abilities to launch opponents out of the arena. Be the last one standing, and claim your title as the ultimate smack talker.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smack Talk</strong> is a 1\u20134 player online platform fighter where voice recognition is used to perform different moves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Voice Commands</strong>: Players must speak specific phrases to execute attacks, defenses, and power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Characters</strong>: Choose from a variety of fighters, each with their own unique move set and a special power-up phrase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Maps</strong>: Battle across multiple maps, each featuring distinct layouts and thematic elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players start at 0% damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they take hits, their damage percentage increases, causing moves to deal more knockback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a character is knocked beyond the stage boundaries, they lose a life.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8<strong>Stylized Art:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy a unique 2.5d pixel art style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020490?t=1758840944","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020490?t=1758840944","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020490/ba9194a2245a74ceb22c40cb3707e3fae22d14aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758840944","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020490/ba9194a2245a74ceb22c40cb3707e3fae22d14aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758840944","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"fu